    "pinned_comment": {
        "author_association": "NONE",
        "body": "I tried several scenarios.\n\n- for `nvim`:\n  - `sudo snap install nvim`\n  - `nvim` from [the official tarball](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/releases/latest/download/nvim-linux-x86_64.tar.gz)\n- for `ruff`:\n  - `sudo snap install ruff`\n  - `uv tool install ruff`\n  - this script in `~/.local/bin/ruff`:\n    ```bash\n    #!/bin/sh\n    exec uvx ruff \"$@\"\n    ```\n\nHere’s the result:\n\n| nvim | ruff | |\n|----|----|----|\n| snap | 0.15.18 (snap) | 🔴 |\n| snap | 0.15.20 `uv tool install ruff` | 🟢 |\n| snap | 0.15.20 `uvx ruff` | 🔴 |\n| tarball | 0.15.18 (snap) | 🟢 |\n| tarball | 0.15.20 `uv tool install ruff` | 🟢 |\n| tarball | 0.15.20 `uvx ruff` | 🟢 |\n",
        "created_at": "2026-06-27T21:01:13Z",
